<h1>Affiliate disclosure</h1>
<p>StackPilot AI may eventually receive commissions if visitors purchase software through eligible affiliate links. <strong>There are currently no active affiliate tracking links in this prototype.</strong> Links to vendors in our catalog lead to official vendor websites, not affiliate tracking destinations.</p>
<p>Our category matching and future recommendation scoring must not depend on commissions, affiliate status, or paid placement. Product information is incomplete, and editorial research is pending. Refer to our <a href="/methodology/">research methodology</a> and confirm claims directly with vendors.</p>
<p>Any future affiliate activation will require program approval, suitable disclosures, verified destination links, and an explicit release decision. None of those actions has been taken for this prototype.</p>
</main><footer>StackPilot AI — Pre-launch prototype · <a href="/privacy/">Privacy notes</a></footer></body></html>
